  "articleBody": "A shower niche should be planned with the wall framing, finished tile layout, plumbing, waterproofing system, and household storage needs in mind. The most reliable installation places it away from direct spray, slopes the bottom shelf slightly outward, and connects every niche surface to the shower’s continuous waterproofing layer before tile is installed.",
